@startuml sq-authChangePassword
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #4A90D9
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam ActorBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #F5A623
skinparam DatabaseFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #C47D0A
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F0C000
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #B0BEC5
skinparam SequenceGroupFontColor #37474F
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #37474F

title <b>POST /auth/change-password</b>\n<i>รองรับ 2 triggers: first_time | expired</i>

actor "👤 User" as User
participant "<b>API</b>\n/auth/change-password" as API #4A90D9
participant "<b>JWT\nMiddleware</b>" as MW #95A5A6
participant "<b>Auth\nService</b>" as SVC #7B68EE
database "<b>Redis</b>" as Redis #E74C3C
database "<b>MongoDB</b>" as DB #F5A623

== 1. Authenticate Token ==

User -> API : <b>POST</b> /auth/change-password\n<font color=gray>Authorization: Bearer {token}\n{ newPassword }</font>
activate API #D6EAF8

API -> MW : validate access token
activate MW #ECF0F1
MW -> MW : parse JWT & verify signature

alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Invalid Signature / Expired</b></font>
  MW --[#C0392B]> API : ERR: UNAUTHORIZED
  API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>401 (1002)</b></font> Unauthorized
end

MW -> Redis : GET token_blacklist:{jti}
activate Redis #FADBD8
Redis --> MW : nil | "1"
deactivate Redis

alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Token Revoked</b></font>
  MW --[#C0392B]> API : ERR: TOKEN_REVOKED
  API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>401 (1002)</b></font> Token Revoked
end

MW -> MW : check scope ∈ ["FULL", "CHANGE_PASSWORD"]

alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Scope ไม่ถูกต้อง</b></font>
  MW --[#C0392B]> API : ERR: INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE
  API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>403 (2010)</b></font> Forbidden
end

MW --> API : claims { userId, jti, scope, trigger }
deactivate MW

== 2. Validate Body ==

API -> API : validate body\n{ newPassword }

alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Validation Failed</b></font>
  API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>400 (1008)</b></font> Validation Failed
end

API -> SVC : changePassword(userId,\nnewPwd, trigger, jti)
activate SVC #E8DAEF

SVC -> DB : db.users.findOne({ _id: userId })
activate DB #FEF9E7
DB --> SVC : user document
deactivate DB

note right of SVC #FCF3CF
  <b>ไม่ verify oldPassword</b>
  Trust JWT token ทั้ง 3 cases
  (trigger ใช้สำหรับ audit log เท่านั้น)
end note

== 3. Validate New Password Rules ==

SVC -> SVC : check newPassword != current passwordHash

alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Same as Current Password</b></font>
  SVC --[#C0392B]> API : ERR: SAME_PASSWORD
  API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>400 (2004)</b></font> Same as current password
end

' ==========================================
' 🚫 ตัดออก 2026-05-25 — ไม่ check password history แล้ว
' code 2011 PasswordReuse comment ไว้ (ห้าม recycle)
' --------------------------------------------------------------
' SVC -> SVC : bcrypt.Compare\n(previousPasswordHash, newPassword)
' note right #FFF9C4
'   <b>Password History (1 ตัว):</b>
'   ห้ามใช้ password ที่เพิ่งเปลี่ยนไปครั้งก่อน
' end note
'
' alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Password Reuse (match previous)</b></font>
'   SVC --[#C0392B]> API : ERR: PASSWORD_REUSE
'   API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>400 (2011)</b></font> Password reuse
' end
' ==========================================

SVC -> SVC : validate complexity rules
note right #FFF9C4
  • length >= 8
  • uppercase + lowercase + digit
  • special character (@$!%*?&)
end note

alt <font color=#C0392B><b>Password Too Weak</b></font>
  SVC --[#C0392B]> API : ERR: WEAK_PASSWORD
  API --[#C0392B]> User : <font color=#C0392B><b>400 (2005)</b></font> Password Too Weak
end

== 4. Update Password & Revoke All Sessions ==

SVC -> SVC : newHash = bcrypt.Hash(newPwd, 12)

SVC -> DB : UPDATE users SET\npasswordHash = newHash,\npasswordChangedAt = NOW,\npasswordExpiresAt = NOW + 90d,\n<b>isTempPassword = false,</b>\n<b>tempPasswordHash = null,</b>\n<b>tempPasswordExpiresAt = null</b>
activate DB #FEF9E7
DB --> SVC : updated
deactivate DB

SVC -> Redis : SCAN refresh_token:{userId}:*\n→ DEL ทุกตัว
activate Redis #FADBD8
Redis --> SVC : OK
deactivate Redis

SVC -> Redis : SET token_blacklist:{currentJti}\nEX ttlRemaining
activate Redis #FADBD8
Redis --> SVC : OK
deactivate Redis

SVC -> DB : insert audit_log\n(PASSWORD_CHANGED, { trigger })
activate DB #FEF9E7
DB --> SVC : ok
deactivate DB

SVC --> API : SUCCESS\n{ passwordChangedAt, passwordExpiresAt,\nrequireReLogin: true }
deactivate SVC

API --[#27AE60]> User : <font color=#27AE60><b>200</b></font> Password Changed Successfully
deactivate API

note right #D5F5E3
  Frontend:
  • Clear tokens จาก storage
  • Redirect → /login
  ➜ บังคับ re-login ด้วยรหัสใหม่
end note

@enduml
